WEBVTT

00:09.700 --> 00:10.700
Matsu...ri?

00:10.700 --> 00:11.530
Matsu...ri?

00:29.090 --> 00:29.920
A dream...

00:52.270 --> 00:58.690
hane ga shiroku hikari mabushiku tondeyuku

00:52.270 --> 00:58.690
White feathers gleam and fly away brightly

00:59.110 --> 01:05.740
kokoro dake nosete hoshii no ni

00:59.110 --> 01:05.740
Though I only want to set my heart on them

01:06.740 --> 01:13.000
tsumetai te wo nobasu todokanai... shitteru

01:06.740 --> 01:13.000
I extend my cold hands - They won't reach... I know

01:13.630 --> 01:20.720
dakedo ima furetai kimi ni

01:13.630 --> 01:20.720
But I want to touch you now

01:20.930 --> 01:26.850
natsukashii kaze ni ha ano koro no fune

01:20.930 --> 01:26.850
On that nostalgic wind - A ship from the past

01:27.260 --> 01:35.270
maboroshi ga omoide wo miseta

01:27.260 --> 01:35.270
An illusion showed me memories

01:36.340 --> 01:45.280
"wasurenai" dareka no koe ga setsunaku hibiku

01:36.340 --> 01:45.280
"I won't forget" Someone's voice echoes painfully

01:45.450 --> 01:50.370
hajimaru yokan ni furuete

01:45.450 --> 01:50.370
Trembling with a foreboding

01:50.660 --> 01:58.710
"wasuretai" negau jibun ga wakaranai

01:50.660 --> 01:58.710
"I want to forget" I cannot understand myself for hoping so

01:59.090 --> 02:08.430
matteiru yurarenagara yume hitotsu wo

01:59.090 --> 02:08.430
I shall wait while swaying, for that one dream

02:13.980 --> 02:19.270
Indelible Thoughts

02:21.570 --> 02:22.990
Yorito.

02:24.870 --> 02:26.410
Hey, are you tired?

02:26.410 --> 02:27.910
Yeah, a little.

02:28.160 --> 02:30.250
Weren't you dozing off just now?

02:30.460 --> 02:31.210
Yeah.

02:31.500 --> 02:34.300
I was watching a DVD with Sis until morning.

02:34.800 --> 02:35.500
What was it about?

02:36.880 --> 02:38.010
Let's see...

02:42.340 --> 02:43.600
I wonder what it was...

02:44.970 --> 02:48.140
You're always so absentminded.

02:49.600 --> 02:50.560
Yorito?

02:51.520 --> 02:52.810
What were we talking about?

02:53.020 --> 02:55.440
Are you really okay?

02:55.440 --> 02:57.030
I think so.

02:57.490 --> 03:01.160
You don't have a fever, but you're not thinking clearly.

03:01.610 --> 03:03.620
Don't make an inaccurate diagnosis.

03:04.120 --> 03:04.950
So... how did it go yesterday?

03:04.950 --> 03:06.370
So... how did it go yesterday?

03:06.370 --> 03:07.500
How did what go?

03:07.750 --> 03:11.000
Didn't Aono-san come to pick you up all dressed up?

03:12.120 --> 03:14.540
Well, we rode the cable car together and...

03:14.540 --> 03:15.670
The cable car?

03:15.920 --> 03:18.710
Since Sis said she wanted to see far into the distance,

03:18.710 --> 03:20.260
we went up to the observation deck.

03:20.630 --> 03:21.800
Even though it was raining?

03:22.010 --> 03:22.930
Even though it was raining.

03:23.720 --> 03:25.970
That sounds almost like a date, huh.

03:26.350 --> 03:28.390
Since we were stuck at home for so long,

03:28.640 --> 03:30.060
we wanted to have a change.

03:30.480 --> 03:31.310
I see.

03:32.060 --> 03:34.810
And as expected we got wet and...

03:35.020 --> 03:36.230
The convenience store...

03:38.360 --> 03:39.240
And...

03:39.820 --> 03:40.400
And...

03:40.400 --> 03:44.490
Of course, if you ride the cable car on a rainy day...

03:44.490 --> 03:46.030
Bought a towel and...

03:44.700 --> 03:45.530
Yorito?

03:46.530 --> 03:48.870
Bought a towel with Sis and...

03:49.620 --> 03:51.790
Bought a towel and...

03:49.790 --> 03:51.120
Hey, what's wrong?

03:51.750 --> 03:52.500
Yorito?

03:52.500 --> 03:53.290
Sis...

03:54.170 --> 03:54.880
Sis...

03:56.630 --> 03:57.500
Yorito?!

03:57.750 --> 03:58.800
Yorito!

04:00.340 --> 04:02.300
Hey, what's wrong?!

04:03.180 --> 04:04.590
Someone get the teacher!

04:05.430 --> 04:06.300
Yorito.

04:06.390 --> 04:07.260
Yorito!

04:07.470 --> 04:08.560
Yorito!

04:10.810 --> 04:11.770
Aono-san.

04:12.020 --> 04:13.020
Aono-san!

04:15.860 --> 04:16.940
Are you all right?

04:16.940 --> 04:17.770
Yeah...

04:20.360 --> 04:21.190
Mana?

04:22.070 --> 04:22.950
Yorito!

04:23.740 --> 04:24.740
I'm home.

04:27.580 --> 04:28.830
I'll be fine now.

04:29.240 --> 04:29.950
Just fine.

04:30.700 --> 04:32.500
You don't look fine at all.

04:32.910 --> 04:35.000
I just feel a bit dizzy.

04:35.250 --> 04:36.290
You're overreacting.

04:36.750 --> 04:39.300
You weren't even able to speak until now.

04:40.840 --> 04:41.630
Aono-san,

04:42.050 --> 04:43.840
I'll get him a wet towel.

04:45.130 --> 04:45.760
Mana.

04:45.930 --> 04:46.430
Yes?

04:48.260 --> 04:49.260
Thank you.

04:55.560 --> 04:56.770
Are you all right?

04:56.770 --> 04:57.520
Yeah.

04:58.110 --> 05:00.520
I just felt a bit dizzy, so...

05:01.030 --> 05:01.690
I see.

05:03.360 --> 05:04.240
What's wrong?

05:04.450 --> 05:05.030
What?

05:05.950 --> 05:07.200
You're looking at me.

05:07.410 --> 05:10.200
Is it wrong to look at my brother's face?

05:10.740 --> 05:12.700
It's not, but...

05:13.700 --> 05:14.830
You have such a long face.

05:15.080 --> 05:16.250
What's that supposed to mean?

05:16.580 --> 05:21.630
Since we're siblings, the same goes for you as well.

05:22.250 --> 05:23.880
I'm not gloomy.

05:24.130 --> 05:25.220
Yeah, yeah.

05:25.970 --> 05:27.340
Has the pain gone away yet?

05:27.550 --> 05:28.220
Yeah.

05:29.300 --> 05:30.470
Sis...

05:30.760 --> 05:32.350
What is it, Yorito?

05:33.100 --> 05:34.810
Last night... what did we eat?

05:34.810 --> 05:35.980
Last night... what did we eat?

05:36.810 --> 05:37.810
Hamburger steak.

05:38.350 --> 05:39.020
At home?

05:39.860 --> 05:40.440
At home.

05:41.480 --> 05:43.940
After that, I suggested we watch a movie and...

05:44.650 --> 05:46.150
A three-pack of horror films.

05:46.400 --> 05:46.990
Yeah.

05:47.820 --> 05:49.110
You're strange Yorito.

05:49.700 --> 05:50.700
So that's how it is.

05:50.910 --> 05:51.950
I'm strange.

05:52.620 --> 05:55.330
It's like I'm never going to wake up.

05:57.830 --> 05:58.460
Hey.

05:58.710 --> 06:02.880
Didn't we meet someone on the way back?

06:04.170 --> 06:05.090
Someone?

06:05.800 --> 06:06.380
Yeah.

06:07.130 --> 06:09.220
Who do you mean by that?

06:09.510 --> 06:10.340
Well... I don't know who, but...

06:10.340 --> 06:12.300
Well... I don't know who, but...

06:12.890 --> 06:15.470
I feel like I'm forgetting something important.

06:16.020 --> 06:16.810
Yorito,

06:17.270 --> 06:19.140
you need to take a nap.

06:19.140 --> 06:19.900
But...

06:20.440 --> 06:21.730
Take a nap.

06:22.310 --> 06:23.270
Sis...

06:33.030 --> 06:33.910
Aono-san.

06:34.950 --> 06:37.160
I don't think he's well after all.

06:37.410 --> 06:38.830
I'm going to have him take a nap in his room.

06:39.000 --> 06:40.790
So are you taking him up to his room?

06:41.380 --> 06:42.040
Yes.

06:42.250 --> 06:43.500
I'll help.

06:43.750 --> 06:44.590
It's fine.

06:45.460 --> 06:46.380
Aono-san?

06:47.090 --> 06:48.840
You can go back home, Mana.

06:48.840 --> 06:49.590
But...

06:50.880 --> 06:51.720
I said it's fine.

06:53.010 --> 06:54.930
If you say so...

07:01.350 --> 07:03.060
I'll be leaving then.

07:13.280 --> 07:14.120
Oh yeah.

07:15.200 --> 07:18.370
Sis, let's go out on a sunny day next time.

07:18.870 --> 07:20.250
I don't like sunny days.

07:20.750 --> 07:25.420
On a sunny day, the sky is a different color, you know.

07:26.340 --> 07:27.630
Yes, sure.

07:31.720 --> 07:32.510
Sis...

07:34.390 --> 07:35.260
Good night.

07:37.060 --> 07:38.640
Good night... Yorito.

07:38.640 --> 07:39.560
Good night... Yorito.

07:47.730 --> 07:49.030
Good night...

07:55.950 --> 07:56.990
Mom?

07:57.240 --> 07:59.560
I'm coming home right now.

08:00.040 --> 08:00.620
Yes.

08:00.620 --> 08:04.290
I'm coming home late because I was talking with my friend.

08:04.880 --> 08:06.710
Yes, I'm fine.

08:06.710 --> 08:07.670
Bye then.

08:19.850 --> 08:20.770
You're in pain.

08:21.140 --> 08:22.350
But... I need to get far away from here.

08:22.350 --> 08:24.100
But... I need to get far away from here.

08:24.520 --> 08:26.110
You can't move any more today.

08:30.480 --> 08:31.360
This way.

08:40.330 --> 08:41.500
Does it still hurt?

08:42.200 --> 08:44.120
It's all right. I rested a bit.

08:44.830 --> 08:45.870
I see.

08:46.130 --> 08:49.500
You don't have to worry about me, so you can go now.

08:49.880 --> 08:52.010
I can't leave an injured person behind.

08:52.630 --> 08:55.630
Don't be cocky when I saved you first.

09:05.520 --> 09:07.230
We're just helping one another.

09:08.190 --> 09:10.690
Are you sure your don't have to go to the hospital?

09:11.020 --> 09:14.700
Don't you have to tend to your burns as well?

09:15.650 --> 09:18.450
It was so foolish of you to not have a parasol at hand.

09:18.700 --> 09:20.870
It's all because it stopped raining so suddenly.

09:23.040 --> 09:24.160
It stopped hurting?

09:24.460 --> 09:25.210
Yes... thanks to you.

09:25.210 --> 09:26.500
Yes... thanks to you.

09:27.000 --> 09:28.830
Then go home as I said.

09:29.290 --> 09:31.000
You weren't alone, right?

09:31.170 --> 09:32.880
I don't have to care about that guy!

09:35.970 --> 09:36.800
I see.

09:43.140 --> 09:43.850
Say...

09:44.350 --> 09:47.310
You haven't asked very much about me.

09:48.850 --> 09:50.020
Should I?

09:50.940 --> 09:52.190
I don't know.

09:53.110 --> 09:56.700
There's no need to know things that are kept secret, right?

09:58.570 --> 09:59.360
Say...

10:00.870 --> 10:03.200
You're a Yaka, right?

10:05.080 --> 10:06.960
So you knew after all.

10:07.410 --> 10:10.080
Why don't you heal a wound as small as that?

10:10.580 --> 10:11.960
It's okay.

10:13.050 --> 10:15.260
It's because I broke a promise.

10:16.220 --> 10:18.180
It's only natural... that I was stabbed.

10:18.180 --> 10:19.800
It's only natural... that I was stabbed.

10:31.770 --> 10:34.940
It's rare that the door is locked.

10:35.230 --> 10:37.740
I wonder if Yorito is feeling better.

10:38.110 --> 10:40.450
I hope it isn't anything serious.

10:40.820 --> 10:41.410
Same here.

10:46.790 --> 10:50.750
The weather's so nice today. Good morning.

10:51.080 --> 10:52.170
Good morning.

10:52.170 --> 10:53.960
Aono-san, how is Yorito?

10:54.250 --> 10:55.630
What's his condition?

10:56.130 --> 10:58.300
I'm going to let Yorito take the day off.

10:58.300 --> 10:59.260
Oh no...

10:59.590 --> 11:00.840
It's just a cold.

11:01.090 --> 11:02.800
It'll go away faster if he rests.

11:02.800 --> 11:03.550
A cold?

11:04.850 --> 11:05.600
I see.

11:06.520 --> 11:07.220
Bye.

11:07.220 --> 11:07.890
Umm...

11:11.940 --> 11:12.940
Never mind. I just hope he gets well soon.

11:12.940 --> 11:14.270
Never mind. I just hope he gets well soon.

11:17.480 --> 11:20.320
It seems like Aono-san is tired.

11:20.820 --> 11:21.780
Yeah...

11:23.820 --> 11:24.910
Yorito...

11:30.040 --> 11:31.290
Sis.

11:31.290 --> 11:32.000
Yes?

11:32.290 --> 11:33.500
I'm here.

11:35.090 --> 11:36.130
Sis,

11:36.130 --> 11:38.670
I'm seeing Matsuri in my dreams.

11:39.670 --> 11:40.760
I...

11:41.090 --> 11:43.010
I stab Matsuri in my dreams.

11:43.680 --> 11:46.180
But I'd never do such a thing.

11:46.600 --> 11:48.180
Isn't it strange?

11:48.520 --> 11:53.440
You're having a dream like that because you don't want to forget Matsuri.

11:53.650 --> 11:54.520
Yorito,

11:54.770 --> 11:56.440
you have to forget her quickly,

11:56.900 --> 11:58.440
or you will be in pain forever.

12:24.720 --> 12:27.260
Is Morimiya-kun absent today?

12:27.680 --> 12:28.430
Yeah.

12:28.430 --> 12:29.680
It looks like he has a cold.

12:29.930 --> 12:30.850
A cold?

12:31.640 --> 12:33.310
That's what Aono-san said.

12:33.310 --> 12:34.270
I see.

12:34.560 --> 12:37.310
Well, you go and pick him up every day, right?

12:37.310 --> 12:38.020
Yeah.

12:38.270 --> 12:42.570
Yet you still say you aren't going out with him. You're so weird.

12:42.780 --> 12:45.280
Well, Morimiya-kun is weird, too.

12:45.280 --> 12:46.320
Yes... he's a bit strange.

12:49.580 --> 12:51.200
Good morning...

12:51.330 --> 12:52.250
Good morning.

12:52.250 --> 12:53.750
Coming to school this late?

12:54.000 --> 12:59.000
I woke up too early today, so I re-slept and then re-re-slept.

12:59.210 --> 13:00.630
That makes no sense.

13:00.960 --> 13:02.550
Forget that. I've got big news.

13:02.550 --> 13:03.420
What, what?

13:03.420 --> 13:04.840
A breaking news photo!

13:04.840 --> 13:05.840
Really?

13:11.220 --> 13:14.520
It's the girl who was with the bearded dandy, right?

13:14.520 --> 13:15.270
Bearded?

13:16.020 --> 13:16.810
Y-Yeah...

13:17.100 --> 13:18.770
Where did you take that?

13:18.940 --> 13:22.150
I saw them by chance on my way home.

13:22.480 --> 13:23.360
Who is she?

13:23.650 --> 13:24.780
Umm...

13:24.780 --> 13:27.160
She's this little girl's mother.

13:27.160 --> 13:28.200
Her mother?!

13:28.200 --> 13:30.370
The rumored Yaka-san.

13:31.240 --> 13:34.370
She was keeping it a secret from the bearded dandy that she was meeting her child.

13:34.710 --> 13:36.290
...for some complex reason.

13:36.620 --> 13:37.540
Are you serious?

13:37.540 --> 13:39.170
I'm 100% positive.

13:39.170 --> 13:42.050
This is another one of your crazy delusions, isn't it?

13:42.050 --> 13:43.760
Of course not!

13:43.760 --> 13:45.840
Doesn't it look like it's true?

13:45.010 --> 13:47.590
Matsuri-san is still near by.

13:45.840 --> 13:48.590
How should I know? There's so much noise in the photo...

13:49.180 --> 13:49.850
There is?

13:50.680 --> 13:51.810
What's wrong?

13:52.220 --> 13:52.970
Sae.

13:53.310 --> 13:55.680
Send that photo to my cell phone.

13:55.680 --> 13:57.310
Yeah, okay, but...

13:57.520 --> 13:58.980
I'm leaving school early.

13:59.600 --> 14:01.110
Hey, Mana!

14:01.480 --> 14:04.990
Tell the teacher I have a stomachache, a headache, and a backache.

14:06.570 --> 14:08.110
What's with her?

14:08.110 --> 14:11.700
I wonder if Mana is one of the people involved in that relationship...

14:12.830 --> 14:14.100
Hey...

14:16.370 --> 14:17.500
Excuse me.

14:17.710 --> 14:19.040
Excuse me!

14:23.880 --> 14:24.920
Aono-san.

14:25.130 --> 14:25.840
Mana.

14:26.340 --> 14:27.340
Is Yorito... Is Yorito awake?

14:27.340 --> 14:28.840
Is Yorito... Is Yorito awake?

14:29.130 --> 14:30.140
Why?

14:30.470 --> 14:31.390
Umm... let me see him.

14:31.390 --> 14:32.600
Umm... let me see him.

14:33.010 --> 14:34.260
Not now.

14:34.260 --> 14:35.470
It's an emergency!

14:36.140 --> 14:37.770
I'll tell him.

14:40.690 --> 14:41.900
Matsuri-san... Matsuri-san's still here! She's still nearby!

14:41.900 --> 14:44.650
Matsuri-san... Matsuri-san's still here! She's still nearby!

14:45.400 --> 14:46.400
Matsuri...

14:46.780 --> 14:47.530
Yes.

14:47.530 --> 14:48.530
Let me see...

14:48.530 --> 14:49.820
I have a photo here.

14:50.070 --> 14:50.700
Go home.

14:51.870 --> 14:52.910
Go home!

14:53.910 --> 14:54.830
Hey!

14:54.850 --> 14:55.580
Go home!

14:56.160 --> 14:58.830
Then tell this to Yorito right away!

14:59.040 --> 15:01.250
She's an important person to Yorito!

15:01.880 --> 15:03.790
You have to tell Yorito or-

15:14.810 --> 15:15.760
What-?

15:16.390 --> 15:17.640
Go home!

15:18.640 --> 15:19.850
Aono-san.

15:20.060 --> 15:20.850
Aono-san?

15:20.940 --> 15:22.060
Aono-san!

15:22.600 --> 15:23.610
Aono-san!

15:23.900 --> 15:25.150
Aono-san!

15:25.360 --> 15:26.570
Aono-san!

15:34.160 --> 15:36.030
What's going on?

16:06.150 --> 16:06.980
Mayuko...

16:22.160 --> 16:23.920
Yori... to?

16:25.830 --> 16:26.960
Yorito...

16:29.710 --> 16:30.920
Yorito...

16:32.090 --> 16:33.170
Matsuri?

16:41.100 --> 16:42.230
Yorito...

16:44.020 --> 16:45.020
Yorito!

16:51.320 --> 16:52.150
Matsuri!

16:52.490 --> 16:53.650
Matsuri!

16:55.240 --> 16:56.070
Yorito!

16:59.330 --> 17:00.370
Yorito!

17:00.910 --> 17:01.830
Yorito-!

17:08.500 --> 17:09.540
Yorito!

17:14.380 --> 17:15.550
Yorito...

17:16.130 --> 17:17.590
Yorito!

17:22.720 --> 17:24.680
Stop it, Yorito!

17:27.400 --> 17:28.900
Come back, Yorito!

17:46.460 --> 17:49.290
Yorito, she's not here!

17:49.290 --> 17:51.290
Matsuri isn't here anymore!

17:52.920 --> 17:55.010
Matsuri... isn't here anymore.

17:55.010 --> 17:56.800
Matsuri... isn't here anymore.

17:57.220 --> 17:58.220
Isn't here...

17:59.140 --> 18:01.220
Matsuri isn't here...

18:08.140 --> 18:09.150
Isn't here...

18:10.810 --> 18:12.110
Yes.

18:15.780 --> 18:16.900
Yorito... I'm sorry!

18:16.900 --> 18:18.320
Yorito... I'm sorry!

18:18.320 --> 18:19.910
I'm sorry.

18:19.910 --> 18:23.620
I made you stain your hands.

18:24.040 --> 18:27.080
I'm the one making you suffer.

18:27.460 --> 18:31.290
Just when we thought we could be happy...

18:31.630 --> 18:35.090
I just wanted to live with you...

18:36.670 --> 18:41.340
I only wanted you to be beside me.

18:42.720 --> 18:44.430
Just being... with you...

18:44.430 --> 18:45.390
Just being... with you...

18:49.890 --> 18:51.900
If you're there, that's all I need.

18:52.610 --> 18:55.150
We're going to start over again. From the beginning.

18:56.190 --> 18:59.570
That way, I won't have to leave you in more pain.

19:05.450 --> 19:08.330
I have to go now...

19:10.920 --> 19:16.500
Yorito, let's live together peacefully after I'm finished.

19:24.430 --> 19:28.600
Matsuri isn't here anymore.

19:38.990 --> 19:41.360
Sorry for barging in...

19:42.110 --> 19:44.820
Since Aono-san won't open the front door,

19:44.820 --> 19:46.240
I have no choice, right?

19:50.620 --> 19:51.660
What's this?

19:53.120 --> 19:54.380
Yorito?!

19:55.420 --> 19:57.750
Yorito, what happened?

19:58.000 --> 19:59.130
Yorito!

20:00.050 --> 20:01.720
This isn't a cold.

20:02.090 --> 20:04.430
What's happened to you?!

20:04.430 --> 20:05.600
Matsuri is...

20:06.550 --> 20:09.140
Matsuri isn't here anymore.

20:10.270 --> 20:14.400
Yes, but she's been gone for so long, and-

20:14.400 --> 20:17.150
Matsuri isn't here anymore.

20:17.520 --> 20:18.900
Yorito?

20:19.030 --> 20:20.940
...isn't here anymore.

20:25.070 --> 20:28.160
Get a grip, Morimiya Yorito!

