20:32.830 --> 20:34.710
Matsuri-san is...

20:43.590 --> 20:44.970
Matsuri...

21:05.780 --> 21:08.370
Hey, Yorito, do you know where she is?

21:34.310 --> 21:35.890
You... aren't here anymore.

21:35.890 --> 21:38.150
You... aren't here anymore.

21:46.280 --> 21:47.700
Morimiya... Aono.

21:47.720 --> 21:48.990
Morimiya... Aono.

21:49.410 --> 21:51.120
You must not be here!

22:13.350 --> 22:22.020
iro aseta page no kioku hitomi tojireba yomigaeru

22:13.350 --> 22:22.020
Memories on a faded page, they revive when I close my eyes

22:22.440 --> 22:31.200
adokenai shoujo no inori
habatakeyo kibou no sora he

22:22.440 --> 22:31.200
Prayers of an innocent girl
Fly away to the sky of hope

22:31.320 --> 22:35.620
nageku mamonaku  toki wa nagareru

22:31.320 --> 22:35.620
